---
// Three signals as three zoom levels. Panel 1: 40 report requests, 35 fast and
// 5 slow (the post's histogram run). Panel 2: one request. Panel 3: the three
// longest spans of the trace, drawn to scale (1227.08, 1220.35, 1218.59 ms).
const W = 900, H = 300;
const dots = Array.from({ length: 40 }, (_, i) => ({ cx: 60 + (i % 8) * 22, cy: 100 + Math.floor(i / 8) * 22, slow: i >= 35 }));
const bars = [
  { y: 100, x: 560, w: 200, l: 'request' },
  { y: 128, x: 560, w: 199, l: 'httpx GET' },
  { y: 156, x: 561, w: 198, l: 'evidence-lab' },
];
---
<figure class="bep10s">
  <div class="bep10s-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Three zoom levels. Metrics: forty report requests as dots, thirty-five grey and five red, for how the service is doing. Logs: one request picked out, for which request. Traces: that one request opened up into its spans, for where the time went inside it.">
    {dots.map((d) => <circle cx={d.cx} cy={d.cy} r="7" class={d.slow ? 'dotr' : 'dot'} />)}
    <text x="40" y="40" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>metrics</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>metrics</tspan></text>
    <text x="40" y="62" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>the whole service</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cả service</tspan></text>
    <text x="40" y="236" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>is this route slow, and how often?</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>route này có chậm không, và bao nhiêu lần?</tspan></text>
    <line x1="260" y1="140" x2="300" y2="140" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="298,134 310,140 298,146" class="arrow" />
    <circle cx="410" cy="130" r="14" class="dotr" />
    <text x="410" y="40" text-anchor="middle" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>logs</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>log</tspan></text>
    <text x="410" y="62" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>one request</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một request</tspan></text>
    <text x="410" y="180" text-anchor="middle" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>id 94520390</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>id 94520390</tspan></text>
    <text x="410" y="236" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>which request was it?</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đó là request nào?</tspan></text>
    <line x1="470" y1="140" x2="510" y2="140" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="508,134 520,140 508,146" class="arrow" />
    <text x="560" y="40" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>traces</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trace</tspan></text>
    <text x="560" y="62" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>inside the request</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bên trong request</tspan></text>
    {bars.map((b, i) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={b.x} y={b.y} width={b.w} height="16" rx="3" class={i === 2 ? 'barr' : 'bar'} />
        <text x="772" y={b.y + 13} class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>{b.l}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{b.l}</tspan></text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x="560" y="236" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>where did the time go?</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>thời gian đi đâu?</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Each signal is a closer look at the same slow report: a crowd of requests, then one of them, then the inside of that one.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Mỗi tín hiệu là một lần nhìn gần hơn vào cùng báo cáo chậm đó: cả đám request, rồi một request, rồi bên trong request ấy.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep10s { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep10s-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep10s svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep10s text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep10s .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep10s .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep10s .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep10s .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep10s .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep10s .boxr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep10s .ln { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep10s .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep10s .dot { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep10s .dotr { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep10s .bar { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep10s .barr { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep10s .axis { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 2; }
  .bep10s .arrow { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .bep10s .arrowr { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep10s figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
